I fixed the failing "single" test case in `parse-range.test.mjs` by updating `parse-range.mjs` to default the `to` value to the `from` value when no range separator (`-`) is present.

```javascript
export function parseRange(text) {
  const [from, to] = text.split("-");
  return { from: Number(from), to: Number(to ?? from) };
}
```
